SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEWEB:https://www.jessejackjones.com

###Block: Epic Metamagic Feats

Absolute Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:An absolute spell cannot be counterspelled, dispelled, or suppressed by any means short of an antimagic field or Mage's Disjunction. Spell slot +8 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Anathema Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:An anathema spell deals 50%% more damage to creatures of a specific type you choose when casting. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Armoring Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:An armoring spell grants you a deflection bonus to AC equal to the spell level for 1 round after casting. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Grand Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:A grand spell has all numeric variables increased by 100%%. Spell slot +6 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Aura Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:An aura spell with a duration of concentration becomes a persistent aura around you for 1 round per caster level. Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.83
Automatic Quicken Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Quicken Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=30	DESC:You can cast spells of 3rd level or lower as quickened spells without using higher-level spell slots. Each time you take this feat, the maximum spell level increases by 3.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.83
Automatic Silent Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Silent Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:You can cast spells of 3rd level or lower as silent spells without using higher-level spell slots. Each time you take this feat, the maximum spell level increases by 3.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.83
Automatic Still Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Still Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:You can cast spells of 3rd level or lower as stilled spells without using higher-level spell slots. Each time you take this feat, the maximum spell level increases by 3.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.83
Banishing Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A banishing spell that reduces an extraplanar creature to 0 HP also banishes it to its home plane. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.83
Blackened Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A blackened spell deals additional negative energy damage equal to the spell level. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Bolstering Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A bolstering spell grants temporary hit points equal to twice the spell level to all allies in its area. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Carnage Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A carnage spell deals 1 point of bleed damage per die of damage dealt. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Cataclysmic Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=30	DESC:A cataclysmic spell has its area of effect multiplied by 10. Spell slot +7 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Collateral Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A collateral spell that targets a single creature also affects all creatures adjacent to the target. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Cutting Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A cutting spell reduces the target's spell resistance by 5 for 1 round. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Deadly Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A deadly spell that reduces a creature to 0 HP kills it instantly (no save). Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.85
True Death Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Deadly Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=30	DESC:A true death spell that kills a creature prevents it from being raised or resurrected except by epic magic. Spell slot +6 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.85
Delay Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A delayed spell takes effect after a delay of 1 to 5 rounds (chosen at casting). Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.85
Distort Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A distorted spell appears to originate from a different location within 30 feet. Spell slot +1 level.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.85
Enduring Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:An enduring spell's duration is multiplied by 10. Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.85
Enhance Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Maximize Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:An enhanced spell has its damage cap removed, dealing damage based on your full caster level. Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Force Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A force spell has its energy descriptor changed to force. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Gilded Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A gilded spell bypasses the effects of globe of invulnerability and similar protective magic. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Golembane Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A golembane spell affects golems and constructs normally, bypassing their magic immunity. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Guardian Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A guardian spell stores itself and activates automatically when a triggering condition is met. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Hasten Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A hastened spell has its casting time reduced by one step (full-round to standard, standard to move). Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Improved Heighten Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Heighten Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:You can heighten spells beyond 9th level. The save DC increases accordingly.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Imprisoning Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:An imprisoning spell traps a creature reduced to 0 HP in a temporal stasis effect. Spell slot +5 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Ineffable Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:An ineffable spell cannot be identified by Spellcraft or similar means. Spell slot +1 level.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Linked Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A linked spell can carry an additional spell of equal or lower level that activates on the same target. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Living Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:A living spell becomes an autonomous ooze-like creature that persists and attacks on its own. Spell slot +5 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Macabre Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A macabre spell deals additional damage to living creatures equal to twice the spell level. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Maelstrom Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A maelstrom spell with an area of effect persists for 1d4 additional rounds after casting. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Perfect Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Maximize Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=30	DESC:A perfect spell has all variable numeric effects automatically set to their maximum AND doubled. Spell slot +8 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Pestilent Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A pestilent spell inflicts a disease effect in addition to its normal effects. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Prismatic Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:A prismatic spell has its energy type randomized among the seven prismatic colors, with additional effects. Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Project Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A projected spell can originate from a familiar, animal companion, or bonded creature. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Shredding Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A shredding spell reduces the target's damage reduction by 5 for 1 round. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Split Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A split spell can affect an additional target within 30 feet of the first. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Stealth Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A stealth spell has no visible manifestation and cannot be detected by see invisibility or similar effects. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Summoned Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A summoned spell creates a temporary construct that casts the spell on subsequent rounds. Spell slot +4 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Unseen Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:An unseen spell's effects are invisible and require a Perception check (DC 20 + spell level) to notice. Spell slot +1 level.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Vast Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Widen Spell	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A vast spell has its area of effect multiplied by 4. Spell slot +5 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Verdigris Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:A verdigris spell entangles all creatures in its area of effect for 1 round per spell level. Spell slot +2 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
Warp Spell	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Metamagic	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:A warped spell can bend around corners and ignore cover. Spell slot +3 levels.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.89
